hde (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Refresh Hyggshi Store: prioritize Vietnamese regardless of desktop locale,
    and support per-user Flatpak discovery and package actions alongside APT.
  * Recommend Flatpak so Store users can enable Flathub without searching for
    the package name themselves.
  * Ship the complete HDE desktop with X11 and Wayland session support, NexWM,
    HDE Cmd, updated SDDM login theme and lock screen.
  * Notify the user when a supervised HDE component or window manager crashes,
    including when automatic restarts are stopped after repeated failures.

 -- HyggshiOSDeveloper <hyggshidev@gmail.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
